## Parent

Part of #90

## What to build

Add a minimal feedback endpoint that stores a thumbs up/down rating, an optional thumbs-down reason (`Wrong numbers`, `Wrong sources`, `Out of date`, `Incomplete`), and a citation reference for reported wrong sources. Storage stays scoped to company and role context so feedback is auditable without leaking cross-company data.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Feedback endpoint accepts rating, optional reason, and citation reference
- [ ] Report-wrong-source control is supported from both answer feedback and source viewer footer
- [ ] Stored feedback is scoped by company and role and cannot cross company boundaries
- [ ] Only the approved reason values are accepted
- [ ] Backend changes keep the OpenAPI contract typed and generated client updated
